{"id":"44dfeb13a23ac5e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Measure11 Martingale Adapted Sequence","display":"df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence — ZFC Measure11 Martingale Adapted Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence — ZFC Measure11 Martingale Adapted Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[../batch16/58-df-L1.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure11-martingale-adapted-sequence — ZFC Measure11 Martingale Adapted Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec5f34b0092e1daf\" href=\"?note=ec5f34b0092e1daf\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-L1.md\">../batch16/58-df-L1.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"20d69bde348c5967\" href=\"?note=20d69bde348c5967\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration\">58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\">\\(L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\)</span> (integrable random variables, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ec5f34b0092e1daf\" href=\"?note=ec5f34b0092e1daf\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-L1.md\">../batch16/58-df-L1.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\\)</span> (conditional-expectation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d139c8e88761c759\" href=\"?note=d139c8e88761c759\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S\\)</span> (filtration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"20d69bde348c5967\" href=\"?note=20d69bde348c5967\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration\">58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MartingaleAdaptedSequence}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MartingaleAdaptedSequence}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MartingaleAdaptedSequence}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F,\\langle\\omega,\\leq\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\omega,L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F(n),\\Omega)\\land\\mathcal F(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land X(n)\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F(n),\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(X(n),X(n+1),\\mathcal F(n),\\mu)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11MartingaleAdaptedSequence}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F,\\langle\\omega,\\leq\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\omega,L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mu))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F(n),\\Omega)\\land\\mathcal F(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land X(n)\\in L^1(\\Omega,\\mathcal F(n),\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(X(n),X(n+1),\\mathcal F(n),\\mu)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The process is a typed integrable sequence, adapted to the filtration, and satisfies the one-step martingale conditional-expectation law through the canonical four-place predicate.</li>\n<li>The filtration receives the ordered index structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\omega,\\leq\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\omega,\\leq\\rangle\\)</span>, rather than the bare carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-L1.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec5f34b0092e1daf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-L1.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md","status":"r